        "TileImage": "$($repository 81c949ff-c1d0-4c84-97ab-e1658d4da2b0).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47.\r\rYour target is Michael Carter, a security guard at the yacht.\r\rMr. Carter used to bully our client, who has a fear of hights, and now it&apos;s time for him to get his revenge.\r\r... What&apos;s that? 47, our analysts just picked up a message from the security team&apos;s communication system; it seems like Mr. Carter&apos;s shift ends in... 70 seconds!\r\rWe&apos;re running out of time. Find a way to infiltrate the yacht, and get justice for our client.\r\rGood hunting, 47, and god speed!",
